@startuml
title ThingsBoard 3.6 Dashboard：配置、Widget 查询与实时更新

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #1F2937
  ActorBorderColor #334155
  ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ActorFontColor #111827
  ParticipantBorderColor #334155
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F3F8
  ParticipantFontColor #111827
  LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  GroupBorderColor #334155
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  GroupHeaderFontColor #111827
  NoteBorderColor #8A5A00
  NoteBackgroundColor #FFF5CC
  NoteFontColor #111827
  DividerBackgroundColor #0B3A53
  DividerBorderColor #0B3A53
  DividerFontColor #FFFFFF
}

actor "Tenant/Customer\nBrowser" as UI
participant "DashboardResolver\nDashboardPage" as PAGE
participant "Angular\nDashboardService" as HTTP
participant "DashboardController" as CTRL
participant "DefaultTbDashboardService" as APP
participant "DashboardServiceImpl" as DS
database "PostgreSQL\ndashboard / relation" as PG
participant "WidgetComponent\nWidgetSubscription" as WIDGET
participant "EntityDataSubscription\nTelemetry WS client" as CLIENT
participant "TbWebSocketHandler\nDefaultWebSocketService" as WS
participant "EntityDataSubService\nTbEntityDataSubCtx" as SUB
participant "EntityQueryRepository\nTimeseriesService" as QUERY
participant "LocalSubscriptionService" as LOCAL
participant "SubscriptionManager" as MGR
queue "TB_CORE /\nnotification queue" as CORE

== A. 读取 Dashboard 配置 ==
UI -> PAGE: route /dashboards/{dashboardId}
PAGE -> HTTP: getDashboard(dashboardId)
HTTP -> CTRL: GET /api/dashboard/{dashboardId}
CTRL -> CTRL: checkDashboardId(id, READ)
CTRL -> DS: findDashboardById(tenantId, dashboardId)
DS -> PG: SELECT dashboard full row
PG --> DS: configuration + assigned_customers
DS --> CTRL: Dashboard
CTRL --> HTTP: 200 Dashboard
HTTP --> PAGE: validateAndUpdateDashboard(dashboard)
PAGE -> PAGE: create AliasController / State / Layout
PAGE -> WIDGET: instantiate each widget by typeFullFqn

note over PAGE,WIDGET
configuration 是应用 JSON 文档；
dashboard 行不保存任何 telemetry value。
end note

== B. Widget 两阶段 EntityData 命令 ==
WIDGET -> WIDGET: resolve datasource alias/filter
WIDGET -> CLIENT: EntityDataSubscription.subscribe()
CLIENT -> CLIENT: allocate cmdId; build EntityDataCmd(query)
CLIENT -> WS: WebSocket wrapper + AuthCmd/JWT + query
WS -> WS: authenticate; validate command
WS -> SUB: handleCmd(session, EntityDataCmd)
SUB -> SUB: create TbEntityDataSubCtx(sessionId, cmdId)
SUB -> QUERY: findEntityDataByQuery(tenant, customer, query)
QUERY -> PG: dynamic count/data SQL
note right of PG
entity tables + relation
+ attribute_kv + ts_kv_latest
end note
PG --> QUERY: PageData<EntityData>
QUERY --> SUB: initial entity/latest data
SUB --> WS: EntityDataUpdate(cmdId, data)
WS --> CLIENT: JSON update
CLIENT --> WIDGET: datasource resolved / init complete

WIDGET -> CLIENT: start()
CLIENT -> CLIENT: same cmdId; build historyCmd/tsCmd/latestCmd
CLIENT -> WS: update EntityDataCmd
WS -> SUB: update existing context
SUB -> QUERY: findAllByQueries(entity, keys, timewindow)
QUERY -> PG: SQL/Timescale history
alt database.ts.type = cassandra
  QUERY -> QUERY: Cassandra async history query
end
QUERY --> SUB: history / aggregation results
SUB -> LOCAL: add time-series/attribute subscriptions
LOCAL -> MGR: local call if entity owner
alt entity owner is remote Core partition
  LOCAL -> CORE: TbEntitySubEvent(entityId, keys, serviceId)
  CORE -> MGR: register remote subscription summary
end
SUB --> WS: initial history/latest update
WS --> CLIENT: EntityDataUpdate
CLIENT --> WIDGET: onDataUpdated / onLatestDataUpdated

== C. 实时 telemetry 回推 ==
UI -> MGR: previous MQTT/Rule Engine save succeeds
note right of MGR
实际入口见第 09 章；只有聚合保存 Future
成功后才调用 onTimeSeriesUpdate。
end note
MGR -> MGR: filter subscribed services and keys
alt WebSocket owner service is local
  MGR -> LOCAL: onTimeSeriesUpdate(entityId, values)
else WebSocket owner service is remote
  MGR -> CORE: ToCoreNotificationMsg(target serviceId)
  CORE -> LOCAL: onTimeSeriesUpdate(...)
end
LOCAL -> SUB: subscription update processor
SUB -> WS: sendUpdate(sessionId, cmdId, update)
WS -> WS: rate limit + bounded outbound queue
WS --> CLIENT: WebSocket JSON
CLIENT --> WIDGET: merge data and redraw

== D. 保存配置与 Customer 分配 ==
UI -> PAGE: edit widget/layout/settings
PAGE -> HTTP: saveDashboard(full Dashboard)
HTTP -> CTRL: POST /api/dashboard
CTRL -> APP: save(dashboard, user)
APP -> DS: saveDashboard(dashboard)
DS -> DS: validate + replaceBase64WithImageUrl
DS -> PG: JPA INSERT/UPDATE dashboard transaction
PG --> DS: committed Dashboard
DS -> DS: title cache eviction + SaveEntityEvent
DS --> APP: saved Dashboard
APP -> APP: autoCommit + audit/action
APP --> CTRL: Dashboard
CTRL --> UI: 200

UI -> CTRL: POST customer/{customerId}/dashboard/{dashboardId}
CTRL -> APP: assignDashboardToCustomer(dashboard, customer, user)
APP -> DS: assignDashboardToCustomer(tenantId, dashboardId, customerId)
DS -> PG: INSERT relation Contains / DASHBOARD
PG --> DS: relation committed
DS -> PG: UPDATE dashboard.assigned_customers
PG --> DS: Dashboard
DS --> APP: saved Dashboard
APP -> APP: audit ASSIGNED_TO_CUSTOMER
APP --> UI: Dashboard

note over DS,PG #FDECEC
assign 方法没有包住两次写入的外层事务。
第二次 save 失败可留下 relation / JSON 漂移；
并发整行更新也没有 @Version 防止 lost update。
end note

== E. 关闭、超限与重连 ==
alt Browser unsubscribes or destroys Widget
  CLIENT -> WS: EntityDataUnsubscribeCmd(cmdId)
  WS -> SUB: cancelSubscription(sessionId, cmdId)
  SUB -> LOCAL: remove entity subscriptions
else outbound queue exceeds limit
  WS --> CLIENT: close POLICY_VIOLATION
else socket disconnects
  CLIENT -> CLIENT: retain reconnect subscribers; reset cmd map
  CLIENT -> WS: reconnect + AuthCmd + rebuild subscriptions
end

@enduml
